{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Turn the Tide",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can bolster injured creatures with your Channel Divinity. Each creature of your choice that can hear you within 30 feet of you regains hit points equal to 1d6 + half your Proficiency bonus (rounded down) + your Charisma modifier (minimum of 1).</p><p>If an creature has half its hit points or less, the healing it receives from this feature is doubled.</p>",
